window.products.push({"id":1151086,"name":"Window Tinting Film for Home, 17.8x78.7 Inch One Way Window Film Privacy Day and Night, Heat Control Sun Blocking Window Privacy Film, Non-Adhesive An","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Au3K2OoTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"New Upgrade Style: Heat Control Window Privacy Film, Provide Privacy Day And Night. Double Privacy Protection: Different from the existing solar film on the market, they provide privacy only during the day, our window tint film provides privacy at all times of the day and night, let you say goodbye to the unpleasant scenery and peeping maniac outside the window, protect your home throughout the day. Heat Control & Anti UV: In summer, the window tint film will keep the room cool by blocking outside heat. In winter, the window tint film will prevent heat from escaping through the windows, keeping the room warm. In addition, this window tint film can blocks 96% of UV rays and other harmful light, protect the skin health of you and your family, prevent oxidative fading of furniture. NO Glue is Healthier: Say goodbye to disgusting and smelly glue, our heat control window privacy film is designed with Static Cling, safe and pollution-free, we always consider the health of you and your family. Easy Installation & Wide Application: Our privacy window film require only water to complete the installation. 1. Measure the window size and wipe it clean. 2. Tear off the backing film of the window film. 3. Spray a lot of water on the windows(MORE WATER MORE BETTER). 4. Apply window film to glass. 5. Please trim the margins and leave enough edge gaps to squeeze out air bubbles easily. When you don't need it at the moment, please roll it up and keep it in good shape for the next time you apply. Our window films can stay on SMOOTH flat glass in bedrooms, kitchens, bathrooms, living rooms, offices and more. PROFESSIONAL AFTER-SALES SERVICE: Before or during the use of the product, if you have any questions and doubts, please do not hesitate to contact us immediately, we will give you a reply within two hours, please believe that we will give you a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Au3K2OoTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CIKE","source_asin":"B09YGQSQB6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1151086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YGQSQB6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YGQSQB6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
