window.products.push({"id":1151294,"name":"BRISA VW Collection - Volkswagen Insulated Stainless Steel Tumbler, Thermo Mug in Original VW Design (Double-Walled/13.5 fl.oz./450ml/Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CBAAW6mwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Double walled thermo mug with stylish Volkswagen lettering and VW logo. Trendy beautiful drinking mug in nostalgic VW design. Design/ Gift Idea/ Other: The large thermo mug is available in various colours. It makes the VW fan heart beat faster! Dive into the Volkswagen world, because the mug has on the one hand the VW logo and on the other hand the lettering \"Volkswagen\". The stylish mug impresses with the upper noble drinking area made of stainless steel. The mug has a plastic screw cap with closable drinking opening and an anti-slip bottom. The gadget leaves nothing to be desired, as it keeps the contents either warm or cool. Conjure up the nostalgic flair in your life. They are a special gift or a souvenir for a camping vacation or a new \"Bulli\" bus / campervan. What could represent Germany better than this cuddly style icon? Transport your enthusiasm for VW into your life. Material/Technical Data: The officially licensed Volkswagen thermal mugs by BRISA are made of stainless steel, double walled and powder coated. There is an anti-slip bottom at the bottom of the mug. They are easy to clean & durable. They can be cleaned in the dishwasher and are stainless. With a plastic screw-on lid that has a regulator for a sealable drinking opening, the contents stay chilled or warmed. The practical mug is best suited for the car or on the road. He beautifies your kitchen or camping equipment and takes you to the Volkswagen world! Set a highlight and give your living area the desired extraordinary \"VW\" touch. Pure nostalgia! Conjure up the feeling of the 50s, 60s and 70s - freedom, wanderlust and lust for life in your life. Dimensions: h = 18 cm, Ø = 8 cm, filling capacity 450 ml / 15 oz.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CBAAW6mwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BRISA","source_asin":"B088TMK3QK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1151294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088TMK3QK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088TMK3QK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
