window.products.push({"id":1151434,"name":"vlionzebra Faux Sheepskin Plush Area Rug, 2x6 feet Anti-Slip Fluffy Rug for Bedroom, Warm Faux Fur Couch Cover for Sofa and Bay Window(Grey)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ptgx2wWHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Ultra Soft Room Rugs】The modern area rug is constructed of plush faux fur on the topside, the bottom is faux sheepskin leather, soft to touch. It is not an animal product which are finished without harming animals, mainly made from high quality artificial fiber. 【Unique Design Brings Different Style】Irregular-shaped shaggy area rugs are rich in tactile appeal design, would distinct accent to your existing decor for best visual impact. Cozy and silky, close to skin, family and friends could enjoy them at ease. 【Keep Your Feet away from Cold Floor】The length of thick faux fur is about 2.3in/6cm, warm and comfortable, prevent you from cold floor and couch in winter. The back of our faux fur rug is made of faux suede materials, not easy to move after you put them on the floor. 【Ideal Decor for Your Home】The bedroom rug is a great choice if you are looking for a floor mat which features both luxury and functional. Perfect for your family room, living room, bedroom, nursery, or other area of your home, as well as a beautiful throw for your sofa and couch. 【Machine Washable】Machine wash on cold with mild detergent and do not overstuff your machine, hand wash will be better, hang to dry naturally without direct heat or sun or with a dryer. The faux fur on surface may become mess, it will be flat again after combing, please don't worry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ptgx2wWHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"vlionzebra","source_asin":"B08F4VDJ9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1151434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F4VDJ9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F4VDJ9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1151435,"name":"In Command by Pat Saunders, 30 by 47-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":110.03,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91UGUwp9LkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features a rooster. Instantly recognizable, the brilliant, saturated colors of Pat Saunders-White;s animal paintings have established her as a national pet portrait artist. Pat brings an element of spontaneity, boldness and humor into a genre that is often stiff and photo realistic. Pat's big 'Ah-Ha!' moment was when she painted her first animal. Fourteen year later, she still finds this an exciting niche. The first animal paintings in this new style and technique gave her a feeling of 'coming home' after a long journey. Pat participates in juried national shows and presents workshops in her home studio and various workshop venues. She donates her work annually to non-profit fundraisers. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91UGUwp9LkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00DNJEI5I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1151435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DNJEI5I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DNJEI5I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
