window.products.push({"id":1151482,"name":"MUZII Office Desk Chairs, Computer Gaming Chairs, Desk Chair with Padded Armrests and Flip-up Armrests Video Game Chairs for Teens, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qc+BOiJdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Flip-Up Arms: This computer chair can flip up to 90 degrees, you can easily flip its arms up and slide it under your desk to save space. This chair can be used as an office chair, desk chair, and racing chair which is suitable for you to play games, work, and rest. Comfortable Gaming Chair: Sponge-filled cushion, do it comfortably, elastic, the size of the cushion is 23 inch * 21.2 inch, the computer chair cushion is very wide, do not worry about squeezing the thighs at all. The backrest of the office chair is also very large, which can relieve the pressure on the back from long hours of work. Sponge-filled armrests allow you to relax your arms when you are tired. Multifunctional Office Chair: The height of the office chair can be adjusted between 40.2 inch-44.1 inch and can be tilted up to 30 degrees. The sleek casters and 360° swivel design feature an electrostatic powder coating for improved wear resistance, gloss, and a three-dimensional effect. It glides smoothly over tile or carpet without scratching the floor. Premium Computer Chair: High quality PU leather, waterproof, durable and easy to clean. TUV certified three-stage SGS cylinder enables you to adjust the height of the desk chair to the floor at will. Five-star basement and PVC stable wheels allow video game chairs to carry a maximum weight of 330 pounds. Easy to Assemble: Follow the instructions and you will find the desk chair easy to assemble. The assembly time is estimated to be about 10 to 15 minutes. High quality PU material can be cleaned with wet paper towel. Ideal Gift: Our office chair is the perfect gift for yourself, your loved ones, family, or friends. With its high quality and modern design, this video game chairs are perfect for the office or home environment. (NOTE: Use this office chair with a floor mat when used on a rug.)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71qc+BOiJdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MUZII","source_asin":"B0BB6LPN3N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1151482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BB6LPN3N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BB6LPN3N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
