window.products.push({"id":1151818,"name":"Thetrazspot Crystal clear straight glass straw set of 4 with cleaning brush 9.5mm x 8 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61di0NxxY+L._AC_SL1436_.jpg","description":"Set of 4 glass straws, 8\" x 9.5 mm, standard diameter, plus a cleaning brush. Made by the glass artists at Thestrazspot. PROTECTS All OF US FROM TOXINS - Plastics can contain dangerous chemicals such as BPA, which have been linked to hormonal disruption, obesity, early puberty, as well as breast and prostate cancers. The coloring in plastic straws can also be poisonous. All glass straws are 100% non-toxic and will not cause any health problems! HELPS PREVENT STAINED TEETH & REDUCE CAVITIES. Research has shown that using a straw can minimize the contact between your teeth and sugary drinks, minimizing the risk of cavities. For the same reason, using a straw also helps to prevent tooth stains from tea and coffee and drink dye. Plastic straws can't be used in hot drinks, but glass straws can so they are GREAT for soup or coffee. RESISTANT TO BREAKING - Like the nearly indestructible Pyrex bowls and plates your mother used, borosillicate glass straws are made of the same material! Naturally clear, borosilicate glass is very strong, making it safe and great for drinking. CLEANS SIMPLY - Rinse them after each use and they're ready to use again. A brush is also included in case anything has adhered to the inside. Glass Straws are dishwasher safe and microwave safe. Don't add to daily pollution and risk your health and others by continuing to use plastic throw-awau straws!! Switch to a Glass Straw Set Now! We guarantee your satisfaction or your money back. HELPS THE PLANET - People in the U.S. use Millions of plastic straws daily. Plastic is not biodegradable, so every plastic straw that has been used since they were invented is still out there somewhere. The good news is that just one person switching to a Glass Straw can keep that much plastic out of the environment forever! All of us can help in a small way to help save the earth for future generations one little bit at a time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61di0NxxY+L._AC_SL1436_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thestrazspot","source_asin":"B00UDJDM44","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1151818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00UDJDM44","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00UDJDM44","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
